@ECHO OFF
ECHO AT28C64 SOCKET CONTROL DIAGNOSTIC - WILLEM 0.0.3
ECHO REMOVE THE EEPROM FROM THE ZIF SOCKET BEFORE CONTINUING.
ECHO SET DIP SWITCHES ON: 1 2 4 6 9. ALL OTHERS OFF.
ECHO HAVE A METER READY. GROUND IS AT PIN 14, ZIF CONTACT 16.
PAUSE
WILLEM D28C64 378 /TRACE
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO FAIL
ECHO DIAGNOSTIC COMPLETED. COPY WILLEM.LOG AND WTRACE.BIN BACK.
GOTO END
:FAIL
ECHO DIAGNOSTIC FAILED - COPY WILLEM.LOG AND WTRACE.BIN BACK.
:END
